Z||000005||DecadenceR||05-29-2001||08:11 PM||||What you need, my friend, is a new blower motor.<BR>Very easy, takes about 15 minutes from under the hood. I think it was 6 bolts and one tube to get out... Then you have to switch the blade mechanisim... While you have the hole open, I'd reach in and clean out the hole if I were you. I got out sooo much lint and dead leaves, i could have filled a small bag.<BR>They're about $40 at a parts store.||||reg||1
